  "description": "Product Description\n\nFeatures\n\nOptimized from the ground up around 27.5″ wheels\n\nLower BB provides that “in, not on” the bike” feel\n\nLower standover height\n\nBSA threaded BB\n\nNarrow Q factor, yet keeps 5” tire capability\n\nMaximum standover height clearance, combined with a volume increase over the previous generation in the main triangle for frame bags – all of it low for the lowest possible center of gravity.\n\nPortage handle to easily lift the bike when using a frame bag\n\nUDH for easy replacement of derailleur hanger, and SRAM Transmission capability\n\n160mm Post mount front & rear. Max Rotor size 203mm\n\nCNC Gusset to maximize to increase durability while balancing maximum tire clearance and keeping chainstay lengths balanced for each frame size\n\nAlloy Fork with 3 pack mounts for expedition and bikepacking capability",
